@Serkan80 as I understand it, using `like` generates an incorrect query with single quotes around the `$regex` operator.

```
Book.list("title like ?1", format("/.*%s.*/i, "harr"));
```

Generates

```
{'title':{'$regex':'/.*harr.*/i'}} 
```

Where it should be

```
{'title':{$regex:'/.*harr.*/i'}} 
```
